{
  "area": "filter",
  "about": "FILTER (ADR-0125): the rows or columns of an array that include keeps; it spills.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "FILTER-001",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "The rows whose value is above 25; the anchor shows the first",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(H1:H5,H1:H5>25)"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": 30}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-002",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "The rows whose value is above 25; the last spills two rows down",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(H1:H5,H1:H5>25)"},
      "check": "ZZ1002",
      "expect": {"value2": 50}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-003",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "Filtered by another column",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(H1:H5,G1:G5=\"Banana\")"},
      "check": "ZZ1001",
      "expect": {"value2": 40}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-004",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "Two conditions multiplied are both",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(H1:H5,(G1:G5=\"Banana\")*(H1:H5>30))"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": 40}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-005",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "Several columns spill across",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(G1:H5,H1:H5>=40)"},
      "check": "AAA1001",
      "expect": {"value2": 50}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-006",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "Nothing kept, and no if_empty, is #CALC!",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(H1:H5,H1:H5>100)"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": "#CALC!"}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-007",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "Nothing kept is if_empty",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(H1:H5,H1:H5>100,\"none\")"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": "none", "kind": "text"}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-008",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "An Entry in the way is #SPILL!",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1001": "x", "ZZ1000": "=FILTER(H1:H5,H1:H5>25)"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": "#SPILL!"}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-009",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "An include of another height is #VALUE!",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(H1:H5,H1:H3>0)"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": "#VALUE!"}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-010",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "An include holding text is #VALUE!",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(H1:H5,G1:G5)"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": "#VALUE!"}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-011",
      "source": "observed",
      "description": "A number in include is TRUE when it is not 0",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=FILTER(G1:G5,H1:H5-20)"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": "Apple", "kind": "text"}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-012",
      "source": "uncertain",
      "description": "Engine's answer, Excel to be asked: COUNTA counts a blank FILTER keeps, as Excel counted SORT's and UNIQUE's (SORT-021, UNIQUE-017) and as it counts the same array sorted, =COUNTA(SORT(FILTER(Q1:Q2,H1:H2>0))); 1 if it passes over it as over a blank cell",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=COUNTA(FILTER(Q1:Q2,H1:H2>0))"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": 2}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-013",
      "source": "uncertain",
      "description": "Engine's answer, Excel to be asked: the blank FILTER keeps, taken out by INDEX, is blank to ISBLANK, as Excel read SORT's (SORT-022); FALSE if FILTER turned it into the 0 it spills as",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=ISBLANK(INDEX(FILTER(Q1:Q2,H1:H2>0),2))"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": true}
    },
    {
      "id": "FILTER-014",
      "source": "uncertain",
      "description": "Refused until Excel is asked: AVERAGE over a blank FILTER keeps is #VALUE!; 7 if it passes over it, 3.5 if it reads it as 0",
      "fixture": "lookupData",
      "cells": {"ZZ1000": "=AVERAGE(FILTER(Q1:Q2,H1:H2>0))"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": "#VALUE!"}
    }
  ]
}
